 management -he will be removed to the CASU. \r\n\r\nMr Davies is subject to PPRC protocol - no contact with anyone under 18 years old without prior assessment-should he be suspected of contact or any increase in risk detected via Intel he will be subject to phone monitoring.","RM33: Victim safety planning":"There is a Restraining Order in place to protect xx xxx:\r\n\r\nYou are prohibited from: \r\n1. Contacting xxx xxx directly or indirectly including via social media \r\n2. Entering any part of any premises occupied by xxx xxx for the time being as their usual place of residence, this is in place until 16/11/23\r\n\r\nThere is also a Restraining Order in place to protect a previous victim xxx xxx:\r\n\r\nYou are prohibited from:- \r\n1. Contacting directly or indirectly xxx xxx, this is in place until further order.\r\n\r\nConsideration of multi agency meetings to further protect victims will need to be considered before release. \r\n\r\nBlocks are on place at HMP Cardiff to prevent contact and safeguard victims. "}]},{"id":"approvals-for-specific-risks","title":"Approvals for specific risks","content":[{"Risk of serious harm":[{"Risk to children":"Medium","Risk to known adult":"High","Risk to public":"High","Overall risk of serious harm":"High","Risk to staff":"Low"}],"NDelius risk flags (registers)":"Contact Suspended\nRisk to Staff\nRisk to Children\nRisk to Known Adult\nRisk to Prisoner\nRisk to Public","Have your received approval for this referral?":"Yes - Approvals detail","Multi-agency public protection arrangements":"Something went wrong. We are unable to include MAPPA information. This risk data must be checked manually outside of this service."}]},{"id":"behaviour-in-cas","title":"Behaviour in CAS","content":[{"Has the person previously stayed in Community Accommodation Services (CAS)?":"Yes"},{"CAS3":"CAS3 detail","Approved Premises (AP or CAS1)":"Approved Premises detail"}]}]},{"title":"Health, disability, culture, and safeguarding","tasks":[{"id":"d